{"mainQuestId":76042,"title":"海賊船の幽霊騒ぎ","description":"海賊船の残骸で宝物を漁っていたトレジャーハンターが幽霊に襲われたという。ケラティの眼には確かに幽霊が出るという噂があるものの、生きている人が襲われたという記録はない。近くで釣りをしているイルマリに話を聞けば、詳しい情報が手に入るかもしれない。","titleTextMapHash":225648287,"descTextMapHash":3841899070,"mainQuestExcel":{"mainQuestId":76042,"titleTextMapHash":225648287,"title":"海賊船の幽霊騒ぎ","descTextMapHash":3841899070,"description":"海賊船の残骸で宝物を漁っていたトレジャーハンターが幽霊に襲われたという。ケラティの眼には確かに幽霊が出るという噂があるものの、生きている人が襲われたという記録はない。近くで釣りをしているイルマリに話を聞けば、詳しい情報が手に入るかもしれない。","chapterId":0,"mainQuestTag":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","activityId":0,"luaPath":"Actor/Quest/WQ76042","mainQuestRaw":{"activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","activityId":0,"chapterId":0,"descTextMapHash":3841899070,"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GMENNHMBBOH":[{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0},{"actionType":"NONE","id":0}],"id":76042,"IELNANBAMLH":"QUEST_PAUSE_RES_DESTROY_CLIENT_ONLY","IGHALKGCHAB":1969570449,"LEFIHLHODBM":[],"luaPath":"Actor/Quest/WQ76042","mainQuestTag":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","MHHFFHCLDKI":true,"PEDANLIDLGE":0,"PEFIFLDHPEE":true,"recommendLevel":0,"repeatable":false,"resId":0,"rewardIdList":[176042],"series":0,"showRedPoint":false,"showType":"QUEST_SHOW","specialShowCondIdList":[],"specialShowQuestId":0,"specialShowRewardId":[],"suggestTrackMainQuestList":[],"suggestTrackOutOfOrder":false,"taskID":0,"titleTextMapHash":225648287,"type":"WQ","unlockDescTextMapHash":428950}},"flow":[{"subQuestId":7604201,"order":1,"stepDescription":"「秘聞の館」へ向かう","stepDescTextMapHash":1852808180,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7604201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":